{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_119_ddnm-title\">DDNM</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">DDNM 用 A†y 固定 range-space 信息，只让 diffusion denoiser 生成 null-space 分量。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Decomposes reverse diffusion intermediate estimates x̂_{0|t} via the Moore–Penrose pseudoinverse A† into a fixed measurement range-space component A†y and a generated null-space component (I − A†A)x̂_{0|t}.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">线性退化测量 y=Ax+n、已知 A 及伪逆 A†、预训练无条件扩散模型</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Linear measurement y = Ax + n, known operator A with pseudoinverse A†, and a pretrained unconditional diffusion model</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">满足或近似满足测量约束的恢复图像样本</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Zero-shot restored image satisfying A x̂ = y while filling null-space details via the diffusion prior</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2212.00490\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_119_ddnm')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_119_ddnm')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DDNM original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/409e066e8c7e455a51ed.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_119_ddnm', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_119_ddnm\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_119_ddnm')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_119_ddnm', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_119_ddnm\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">测量 y 与算子 A</span><span class=\"lang-en\">y A</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">超分、修复、去模糊、压缩感知等线性逆问题</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests linear measurement y = ax + n, known operator a with pseudoinverse a†, and a pretrained unconditional diffusion model and prepares initial tensor representations (y A).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"超分、修复、去模糊、压缩感知等线性逆问题\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests linear measurement y = ax + n, known operator a with pseudoinverse a†, and a pretrained unconditional diffusion model and prepares initial tensor representations (y A).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"测量 y 与算子 A\" data-node-name-en=\"y A\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_119_ddnm', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">测量 y 与算子 A</span><span class=\"lang-en\">y A</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">超分、修复、去模糊、压缩感知等线性逆问题</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests linear measurement y = ax + n, known operator a with pseudoinverse a†, and a pretrained unconditional diffusion model and prepares initial tensor representations (y A).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从高斯噪声开始的逆扩散变量\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes xt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"扩散状态 xt\" data-node-name-en=\"xt\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_119_ddnm', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">扩散状态 xt</span><span class=\"lang-en\">xt</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从高斯噪声开始的逆扩散变量</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes xt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"无任务再训练地从 xt 估计 clean x0|t\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs pretraining diffusion denoiser within the core range null space decomposed diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"预训练 diffusion denoiser\" data-node-name-en=\"pretraining diffusion denoiser\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_119_ddnm', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">预训练 diffusion denoiser</span><span class=\"lang-en\">pretraining diffusion denoiser</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">无任务再训练地从 xt 估计 clean x0|t</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs pretraining diffusion denoiser within the core range null space decomposed diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"A†y 给出由测量确定的解分量\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs A† range space within the core range null space decomposed diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"A† 范围空间锚点\" data-node-name-en=\"A† range space\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_119_ddnm', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">A† 范围空间锚点</span><span class=\"lang-en\">A† range space</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">A†y 给出由测量确定的解分量</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs A† range space within the core range null space decomposed diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"(I−A†A)x0|t 保留生成先验只能在 null space 补充的分量\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs null space projection within the core range null space decomposed diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"零空间投影\" data-node-name-en=\"null space projection\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_119_ddnm', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">零空间投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">null space projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">(I−A†A)x0|t 保留生成先验只能在 null space 补充的分量</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs null space projection within the core range null space decomposed diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"A†y+(I−A†A)x0|t；含噪版按噪声方差调整\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs x̂0|t within the core range null space decomposed diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"x̂0|t 数据一致估计\" data-node-name-en=\"x̂0|t\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_119_ddnm', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">x̂0|t 数据一致估计</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x̂0|t</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">A†y+(I−A†A)x0|t；含噪版按噪声方差调整</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs x̂0|t within the core range null space decomposed diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由校正的 clean estimate 采样下一时间步\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies DDPM update to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"DDPM 逆步更新\" data-node-name-en=\"DDPM update\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_119_ddnm', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">DDPM 逆步更新</span><span class=\"lang-en\">DDPM update</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由校正的 clean estimate 采样下一时间步</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies DDPM update to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"循环到 t=0 得到一个或多个可行样本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces zero-shot restored image satisfying a x̂ = y while filling null-space details via the diffusion prior via zero-shot.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"零样本恢复结果\" data-node-name-en=\"zero-shot\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_119_ddnm', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">零样本恢复结果</span><span class=\"lang-en\">zero-shot</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">循环到 t=0 得到一个或多个可行样本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces zero-shot restored image satisfying a x̂ = y while filling null-space details via the diffusion prior via zero-shot.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DDNM Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 扩散估计的范围空间替换与零空间保留</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Range–Null Space Decomposition: x̄_{0|t} = A†y + (I − A†A)x̂_{0|t}</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DDNM：核心公式 · 扩散估计的范围空间替换与零空间保留\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"119\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"15.302343pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.279199 -68.95266 165.146763 15.302343\" width=\"165.146763pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.448886-2.391035C3.448886-3.876374 2.78954-4